    "text": "By Katie Morrison-O’Day ,\n1 days ago WORCESTER -- The Worcester boys lacrosse team doesn’t have a lot of the advantages that more affluent towns and schools may have, especially when it comes to a pipeline of youth lacrosse that can feed the high school team. But that isn’t stopping the Wildcats from keeping boys lacrosse alive in the city. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
